        this.addAnnotation((ENamedElement)this.getSwServiceArg_SwArraysize(), source, new String[]{"documentation", "The existence of <swArraysize> turns the parent element into a multidimensional object. It is then possible to create arrays of variables, parameters etc. <swArraysize> should ** to imitate stereotypes such as curves or maps since these structures are stored in the DTD itself as own elements, refer to <swCalprmAxisSet> for a <swCalprm>. Apart from that any array can be created."});
