        this.addAnnotation((ENamedElement)this.swServiceReentranceEnumEEnum.getELiterals().get(0), source, new String[]{"documentation", "If this element is not defined the service cannot be invoked when it is executing."});
        this.addAnnotation((ENamedElement)this.swServiceAccessedElementSetEClass, source, new String[]{"documentation", "This element is similar to <SW-INTERFACE-ACCESSED-ELEMENT-SET> but applies to <SW-SERVICE> . To some extent it is now possible to epress the access to interface elements\r\n\r\n* within a software component represented by ( <swFeature> ), which is the mainly a functional view\r\n\r\n* within a process represented by <SW-SERVICE>, which is more the dynamic view. These processes are part of compontents (represented by ownership and imports, which makes it possible to retrieve the functional view from the dynamic view (but ** vice versa)."});
